<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3975/80 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7306/11 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9467/72 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4720/30 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.71/72  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8372/82   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1718.5/9.1  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     126.70/75   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7855/30   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0721/71   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5895/15   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6230/40</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$341.50/00</p>
</text>
